@startuml seller-status-state-diagram
!define STATE_START #90EE90
!define STATE_PROCESS #87CEEB
!define STATE_ACTIVE #FFD700
!define STATE_ERROR #FF6B6B

[*] --> USER_REGISTERED

USER_REGISTERED --> SELLER_ONBOARDING_REQUESTED : User taps\nBecome a Seller

SELLER_ONBOARDING_REQUESTED --> STRIPE_ACCOUNT_CREATED : Backend creates\nStripe Connect account

STRIPE_ACCOUNT_CREATED --> ONBOARDING_IN_PROGRESS : Stripe sends\nonboarding link

ONBOARDING_IN_PROGRESS --> ACTIVE : Seller completes all\nverification steps

ONBOARDING_IN_PROGRESS --> RESTRICTED : Stripe detects\nincomplete/suspicious data

RESTRICTED --> ONBOARDING_IN_PROGRESS : Seller fixes\nMissing information

ACTIVE --> PAYMENT_PENDING : Buyer initiates\ncheckout

PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED : Payment confirmed\nby Stripe

PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : Payment declined

PAYMENT_FAILED --> PAYMENT_PENDING : Buyer retries

PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED --> SELLER_PENDING_PAYOUT : Backend creates\npayout record

SELLER_PENDING_PAYOUT --> SELLER_PAID : Stripe sends funds\nto seller bank

SELLER_PENDING_PAYOUT --> PAYOUT_FAILED : Stripe encounters\npayout error

PAYOUT_FAILED --> SELLER_PENDING_PAYOUT : Backend retries\nor manual intervention

SELLER_PAID --> ACTIVE : Cycle complete,\nready for next sale

ACTIVE --> ACTIVE : [Multiple transactions]

note right of USER_REGISTERED
  User just registered
  No seller status yet
end note

note right of SELLER_ONBOARDING_REQUESTED
  User wants to enable payouts
  Create Stripe Connect account
end note

note right of ONBOARDING_IN_PROGRESS
  Seller entering personal & bank info
  Stripe is verifying identity
end note

note right of ACTIVE
  Seller verified ✓
  Charges enabled ✓
  Payouts enabled ✓
  Ready to receive payments
end note

note right of RESTRICTED
  Seller has incomplete/rejected info
  Cannot receive payments yet
  Must complete onboarding
end note

note right of PAYMENT_PENDING
  PaymentIntent created
  Awaiting buyer card confirmation
end note

note right of PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED
  Stripe confirmed payment
  Funds moving to seller account
end note

note right of SELLER_PENDING_PAYOUT
  Funds pending payout
  On Stripe payout schedule
  (daily/weekly/monthly)
end note

note right of SELLER_PAID
  Funds arrived in seller bank
  Payout completed
  Ready for next transaction
end note

note right of PAYOUT_FAILED
  Stripe failed to deposit
  Usually: bank account issue
  Seller must update bank info
end note

@enduml
